  border:1px dashed var(--hairline);border-radius:4px}

/* What moved on its own between the last build of this page and this one. A strip rather
   than cards, because the whole claim being made is that there are only ever a handful --
   and it is absent entirely when there are none, which is the load-bearing behaviour and
   not a saving of space. Deliberately quieter than .news above it: that section is about
   work whose clock is yours, this one is about work that moved while you were elsewhere,
   and most of its rows are background arcs you were right not to be watching. */
.lb{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
