.lb .cl[data-k="pipeline-green"]::before{background:var(--calm)}
@media(max-width:640px){.lb li{grid-template-columns:3.4rem 1fr}
  .lb .cls{grid-column:1/-1}}

/* The conditions, as peers. There is no defensible exchange rate between "a reviewer asked a
   question six days ago" and "79 commits exist nowhere but this laptop" -- ranking them
   against each other invents one, and the swathe of unpublished work is a primary problem
   in its own right rather than a lesser version of a stalled review. So: no hero figure
